<lb n="16"/>trüwen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear> in
<lb n="17"/>allem dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jehnigen</unclear> so uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mueglich</unclear>
